From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:50:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(widgets): add blurred text shadow to SVG status badges

shields.io added a blurred shadow behind badge text to improve the
contrast (WCAG) of white text on lighter backgrounds. Render the same
blurred shadow in the Weblate SVG status badges so they keep matching
the shields.io look. The shadow texts are hidden from assistive
technologies.

Fixes #21853
